# A local pnpm content-addressable cache, never a build output this repo
# ships — should never end up committed regardless of what created it.
.pnpm-store/

# apps/website (Vercel) — the local project-link directory `vercel link`/
# `vercel dev` creates; can hold a project id/org id and, in some CLI
# versions, cached env values. Never present today, but this repo has
# already been burned once by a real credential landing in a tracked file
# (see CLAUDE.md's "no credential VALUES in any committed file" rule) —
# cheap insurance against the same mistake showing up here.
.vercel/
